+## 2026-11-06: 0211 restores Bluetooth media audio; planar Metal import blocks video picture; 0212 prepared
+- USER confirms headphones are Bluetooth. On 0211 Safari YouTube now plays audible audio through Bluetooth, but video picture does not play; built-in speaker still silent. Do not claim 3.5 mm or mic success.
+- Fresh reproduction: no mediaserverd/backboardd/SpringBoard crash records; decoded two-plane 640x360 420v surfaces reach WebKit. backboardd logs exact refusal: planar IOSurface textures are not implemented. 0211 stride correction is retained as confirmed partial progress.
+- 0212 userspace changes on isolated codex/media-0212: NV12 420v/420f plane 0 -> Metal R8, plane 1 -> RG8; use actual plane dimensions/stride/address, checked offsets into the same full backing allocation. Reject wrong format, plane index, bytes-per-element, bounds or non-64-byte plane alignment. Planar backing is imported directly, without the nonplanar row-shadow transformation. Existing BO cache retains one backing by surface ID. Preserve actual iosurfacePlane on the Metal texture object.
+- Real frontend + transport layout function host test passes both planes, offsets, unsupported/malformed cases, retained lookup references and unchanged BGRA import. Pinned donor transformation applies and generated plane ivar/getter/setter/call agree. Full native iOS build and device test pending. Existing older whole-transport mock suite was found stale against current unrelated memory-map APIs; no pass claimed for it, and no unrelated mock rewrite retained.
+- No speaker/amp/DSP or Bluetooth configuration changes. Main DeepSeek/audio checkout untouched; current phone stays on working 0211. Next build native-metal.yml, verify artifact/provenance and back up installed bundle before any replacement.
+
 ## 2026-11-06: 0211 native stride fix verified on hardware; Wi-Fi startup passed
 - USB SSH works; UTC corrected. Same synthetic two-plane helper now reports widths 64/32 and row strides 64/64, matching requested rows. Baseline 0209 returned 0/0 for those rows. Temporary helper removed. This establishes the serializer fix on hardware, not complete video playback.
 - Fresh wland log: WMI READY, HTT version ready, initial scan completed, interface announced. USER requested to connect Wi-Fi, check haptic feel, then one Safari YouTube/headphone test; result pending. Headphone transport clarification still pending.
diff --git a/tools/check-sweet-planar-import.py b/tools/check-sweet-planar-import.py
